# SIGINT while readline is in the middle of a multi-key command: the state
# cleanup in readline() mode and rl_callback_sigcleanup in callback mode.
tags: signals SIGINT
--- script
readline "> "

=== sigint-in-numeric-arg-readline
tags: numarg
description: the echoed ^C is only partially overwritten on screen, so the screen is not compared
ignore: screen cursor
keys: abc\M-1\M-2\C-c<dumpfull>x\r

=== sigint-in-key-sequence-readline
tags: keymap
keys: abc\C-x\C-c<dumpfull>\r

=== callback-sigint-in-noninc-search
tags: callback rl_callback_sigcleanup non-incremental-reverse-search-history
--- script
def onint
rl_callback_sigcleanup
dumpfull
end
add_history "make all"
onsig onint
callback "> "
--- keys
abc\M-pmak\C-c<pause>x\r

=== callback-sigint-in-execute-named-command
tags: callback rl_callback_sigcleanup execute-named-command
--- script
def onint
rl_callback_sigcleanup
dumpfull
end
onsig onint
callback "> "
--- keys
abc\M-xback\C-c<pause>x\r

