=== callback-sigint-in-vi-motion
tags: callback rl_callback_sigcleanup vi
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
set keyseq-timeout 50
--- script
def onint
rl_callback_sigcleanup
dumpfull
end
onsig onint
callback "> "
--- keys
abc\e<pause>d\C-c<pause>x\r

